{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-13_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-13","title":"土地震颤","storyCode":"11-15","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-13_beg.txt","sourceHash":"90cc28712750614150953841f0d9e1a179fd22b0c76ea1d1b81e9db7e30c60dc","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"指挥塔上下，罗德岛与自救军联军正与萨卡兹激战，不料食腐者大军提前归来。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些该死的打不完的反抗军！从萨迪恩区一路折腾到这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你们那个又大又猛的铁东西弄出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说自行炮？萨卡兹，我们还有许多士兵在前面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给他们一个信号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"自行炮的攻击范围太大，他们来不及撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走不掉是他们的事。我们的战士都知道怎么在战场上活命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边——可移动的机械源石炮！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这都什么玩意儿啊，这根本不是普通炮弹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔也有什么我没听说过的高等研究院吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这么短的时间内......曼弗雷德是怎么做到的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"无人机找到操控区域了吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"集中注意力。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"操控区域......操控区域......糟了啊博士，这炮弹附带的源石技艺对我的无人机有干扰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了，伦蒂尼姆的系统容易破解，但萨卡兹的巫术很难搞定啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，交给我们吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，费斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照你说的，我们都准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工程小组会确保无人机畅行无阻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有主意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐，这些自行源石炮都是我们工厂组装的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你该不会是准备现场拆了它吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，可露希尔小姐，要是我们工程小组都是血魔的话，说不定可以试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过很可惜，我们大多都只是平平无奇的工匠而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是很熟悉这些用自己的双手造出来的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们知道该怎么瞄准它们的弱点，为真正强大的战友们创造机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到底，这就是我们工程人员能在战场上发挥的最大作用，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这滑索......你准备爬到它背上去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要控制住它的炮口，无人机就能照常工作，没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理论上是这样，可这也太冒险了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们之间的合作，可露希尔小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦你和博士帮我们锁定最安全的落点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"炮火声中，费斯特注视着眼前的这片战场。\n他看到的不再是凶狠的萨卡兹，而是最熟悉不过的流水线旁的机械。大型机械移动的声响，和他最熟悉的节律也没什么分别。\n他会用自己的方式把属于他们的城市夺回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......我一直很想看看这片战场上空的风景，这不正是个好机会吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的机械缓慢地行走在街道上。\n与它庞大的躯干相比，战场上的人们，无论是维多利亚人，还是萨卡兹，都是那么渺小。\n它的脚步无人可挡，它的视线能轻易地熔穿街道。\n它仿佛是这座钢铁丛林的主宰。\n可它突然发出一声悲鸣。\n在它视野的盲区，十几只钩爪飞了过来，牢牢地嵌在了它最脆弱的脖颈处。\n紧跟着，数十个小小的人影顺着滑索攀到了它的背上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们控制住了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"狙击手，清理附近的敌人！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":true,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"术师们，攻击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你，女妖，你甚至不愿意让一滴血液近你的身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你操控的每一滴血液中都蕴藏着你的巫术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......女妖的咒术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是从什么时候开始，女妖变成你这副死板无趣的模样的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，它们过去是如何披着夜色滑翔，一声声地吹响骨哨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们用尖锐又哀伤的声浪哀悼在荒野上迷失的过客，同时却毫不留情地将漆黑的骨爪刺进这些可怜人的后脑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖，这才是女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们从来都是血魔最为欣赏的猎手。我们在战场上并肩作战，以恐惧为武器，收割那些弱小的敌人的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如今的女妖们已经迷失。你们把真实的自我囚禁在和那些莱塔尼亚的术师差不多的装束中，老气横秋，装模作样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔，真正的迷失者恐怕是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岁月不容抗拒地冲刷着大地，也塑造着大地上的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为何不低头看看你自己？你也早就失去了最初的形貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......我又何必在意一副皮囊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这副皮囊，却和我的法袍一样，是我们如今行走大地的真实模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古老王庭的根须早已朽烂，如今的王庭徒具树冠，却依旧不肯坠向地面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多么荒诞......已死之物仍在从本就贫瘠的土地上攫取养分，从而夺去了所有新生的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这才是你的真实目的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"笑容从血魔的脸上消失了。在他身侧，沸腾的血液安静了一瞬。\n隐隐的震动从地面传来，上层地面随之开始摇晃。\n血液。是血液在行军。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干员们，防御！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下方战场......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他突然意识到自己已在这里停留太久。这座城防军指挥塔的弱点并不只有莱托一个。\n当他和血魔的注意都被眼前的“魔王”和旧识吸引时，罗德岛和自救军的人可能正在从另一条路靠近他们想要的情报。\n这才是罗德岛的计划，他们并没有把握在指挥塔上迅速击败他和血魔，他们只是想拖延时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太迟了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是的，太迟了。他可以用一条胳膊来摆脱阿斯卡纶的纠缠，但真正拦住他的是眼前的血海。\n血魔已经被激怒了。他们被一齐困在了这片战场上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟想毁去王庭......毁去萨卡兹的传承本身？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"铺天盖地的血潮包裹住了整座指挥塔。罗德岛的干员们，城防军的士兵们，即将全部被淹没。\n直到一股无形的力量将这血红色的海水分开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i18"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不为摧毁，只为自救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别再让过于漫长的回忆束缚你自己。从旧日的骄傲中解脱出来吧，萨卡兹古老的王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i18"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹已经改变。萨卡兹必须改变。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i18"},{"type":"narration","text":"骨笔之下，一圈又一圈金色的咒文正在自动书写。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i18"},{"type":"narration","text":"血液因主人的愤怒而咆哮着，从地面，从墙上，从头顶扑过来，却都无法靠近年轻的女妖，以及被他护在身后的所有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i18"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只因咒术之王已在异邦的高塔上划定了规则。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，指挥塔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"战况很激烈。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我相信阿米娅、Logos还有阿斯卡纶。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......他们真的拖住了那可怕的家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，无人机成功抵达操控区域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在开始骇入......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"预计需要多久？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"请告诉我还需要多少时间。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半个小时......不，二十分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我知道阿米娅他们还有自救军的各位都很不容易......相信我，我恨不得自己能多长几只手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的机械再度发出一声吼叫。\n原本静止的炮口重新转动起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自行炮顶上的战士们被攻击了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有敌人在远处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是萨卡兹！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这群萨卡兹用的不知道是什么法术！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"突然就......喘不过气......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是赦罪师的巫术。这些萨卡兹是赦罪师的卫兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗法术也来不及挽救被这样的巫术急速消耗的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让费斯特带着战士们撤离自行炮附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是这样的话，这武器又会失去控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战士们的生命是非常珍贵的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失控的武器......我会去摧毁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......指挥官，我舒服多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥官，这是您......您的法术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这光辉......是流动的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起我的......嗯，它更有温度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快、快看！那个突然出现在赦罪师卫兵身后的人是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白色的角，黑色的长袍，那也是......赦罪师？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个赦罪师在......跟其他萨卡兹作战！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，那是——那是闪灵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你叫闪灵来的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希与她保持着联系。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她的行动出于她自身的意志。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然早就知道闪灵很厉害，但这还是我第一次见到她在战场上的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么说呢，很......很......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能明白她为什么不那么愿意战斗了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赦罪师大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您还是来到了这片战场上。您又一次违背了首领的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我的行动依旧要受他辖制，那我的离开岂不是失去了意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就这么痛恨首领？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我痛恨的从来不是他。我痛恨的是我自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卫兵脸上的面具裂开了，赦罪师的剑鞘上倒映着他倒下之前的表情。\n闪灵注视着对方，眼神既平静又悲哀。\n又一次，生灵的火闪动的最后一个刹那——永远地留在了她的剑上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g7_controltower"},{"type":"narration","text":"血雾在咒术的力量下迅速地蒸发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而在那一道道被咒术撕扯出来的裂隙中，无数黑色的能量束穿刺而出。\n笼罩着指挥塔的血潮终于退去了些许。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的剑......还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大君，我们该速战速决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别干扰我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鲜血咆哮着将曼弗雷德逼退了几步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡纶的袖剑如影随形，他知道对方不会让自己轻易脱身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赤色雷光在指挥塔上方的云层一闪而过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......提卡兹之根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当然认得它，就像我认得你的袖剑一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......信号。你在通知他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，我们没有多少时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，只要带走莱托......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心防御。血魔的力量远不止于此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......又浪费了很多血。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刚才的战斗远远无法让血魔尽兴。\n他看向躲在一旁的维多利亚士兵们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！你......不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有关系的，莱托。很快就连你的命都不必留下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中校......中校！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"士兵们无法再言语。\n他们跌跌撞撞地走到血魔身前，一股又一股血液正从他们脊柱的位置喷出来，取代了他们的手和脚，替他们听从命令，迅速地行进。\n他们受到了血魔大君的赐福。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手吧，尽情地动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血液不会因为生命的消逝而干涸，只会随着你徒劳的动作而更快地奔涌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的士兵们不再听从他的命令。\n他看着他们前进，前进，直至走到天台边缘。\n萨卡兹们的战斗几乎快要摧毁这座塔。他们的眼睛里都没有这些处于生死之间的普通士兵。\n士兵们大多数是维多利亚人，和他出身不同，他们甚至直到此刻都不知道他出于什么目的与萨卡兹做了什么交易。\n他们只是跟着他走到这里，跟着他走向悬崖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他知道自己不该动的。只要他躲在后面，血魔和曼弗雷德就不会急着杀死他。\n可他还是想要抓住那些快要下坠的士兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色......能量束......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莱托中校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从你的眼睛里......我感受到了痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认为自己是高卢人。你爱着那个已经逝去的庞大幻影，想要拼命抓住它，把它带回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的相信萨卡兹许下的诺言吗？你真的相信......重建高卢的梦想能够实现吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很恐惧，中校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你假装自己仍有希望......只是因为你不愿意面对自己想要逃避战争的懦弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你逼迫自己相信，这一切牺牲与付出都是为了高卢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你......忘不了那些受你欺骗、被你引向死亡的士兵的眼神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......他们口中那个......幼小的魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是你的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你现在......拉住了我。你不想看见我就这样死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们叫你魔王，而我看见的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一个温柔的孩子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"剧烈的痛苦突然攫住了她。\n并不是眼前的黎博利做了什么，也并非来自血魔和曼弗雷德的源石技艺。\n因为这根本就不是攻击。\n阿米娅，阿米娅。\n有一个声音正在呼唤她，轻柔得就像雪白的刚刚晒过的羽被。\n阿米娅猛地抬起头。\n头顶的天空砸向她，浓厚的阴云向她涌过来，从头到脚吞没了她。\n......宛如一个紧到窒息的拥抱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，指挥官，我们重新控制住了自行炮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分钟......再给我十分钟，我就能全部搞定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......博士，这几天以来第一次，我觉得我们搞不好真的能赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可露希尔小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真希望你没说刚刚那句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怀疑我说出来了就会......就会......哇哇哇博士，什么情况，我的侦察无人机一下子就全部开始疯狂发出警报了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要不说话啊，你不说话我真的很怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（警告的低鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"凯尔希回来了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希不是在帮我们拖延......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你该不会是想说......食腐者的大军提前回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们的行进也许并不会发出声音。否则的话，不会没有人注意到他们早已穿过了城墙，跨过了半座城市。\n这脚步声只是一种信号，通过震颤的地面，抵达战场上每一个人的心脏。\n目所能及的每一条街道上都站满了萨卡兹的战士。\n头顶云层垂下的阴影并不能笼罩他们，因为他们就是阴影本身。他们正笼罩着大地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["闪灵"]}]}
